      ],
      "statement": "Taiwan Union Technology (a high-speed CCL maker and buyer of copper foil and glass cloth), 2025 annual report: the supply increments and adjustments of Low Dk1, Low Dk2 and Q-glass cloth and HVLP3/HVLP4 copper foil needed for CCL upgrades 'clearly affect the supply bottleneck of CCL & PCB'; Low Dk1 cloth tightness is easing as weavers expand, while Low Dk2 cloth is still clearly constrained by suppliers' expansion pace; copper foil is ~35%, glass cloth ~25% of CCL cost. Counter-statement in the same report: its main raw materials each have two or more suppliers and there has been no supply shortage or interruption in the past.",
      "subject_id": "e2"
    },
    {
      "confidence": 0.6,
      "demand_proof_level": "inferred",
      "disproof_condition": "條件：台燿後續年報或法說不再把 Q glass 列為 CCL 升級所需的玻璃布，或寫明其高速 CCL 不用 Q 布。核查頻率：每年（台燿年報）＋每季（法說簡報）。觸發後 48 小時：e6 降 confidence，重讀石英布節點的需求側。",
      "id": "mops_6274_annual_report_2025_hvlp_lowdk_bottleneck_cl2",
