      ],
      "statement": "Taiwan Union Technology (a high-speed CCL maker and buyer of glass cloth), 2025 annual report: Q glass cloth is listed together with Low Dk1 and Low Dk2 cloth as the glass cloth needed for continued CCL material upgrades, and the supply increments of these high-end materials 'clearly affect the supply bottleneck of CCL & PCB'. Names Q glass as a CCL input; does not give its share, nor which TUC products use it (its ThunderClad 5Q / TU-953Q datasheet lists glass styles 1035 and 1078 without the glass type).",
